# Undifferentiated Symmetry

This file defines the corrected beginning.

The beginning is not:

nothing  
vacuum  
empty space  
a point inside space  
a location  
a container  
a clock  

Those already assume a stage.

If the stage itself has not been earned yet, then the beginning cannot be described as something happening inside space or before time in the ordinary sense.

## Why not nothing

Nothing is unstable as a starting word.

If nothing is treated as an object, it is no longer nothing.

If nothing has properties, it is no longer nothing.

If nothing is located somewhere, it already assumes space.

If nothing exists before something, it already assumes time.

So this repo does not begin with nothing.

## Why not vacuum

Vacuum is not nothing.

A vacuum is already a physical condition.

It belongs to a framework.

It assumes a field structure, a background, or a definable state.

So vacuum is too late.

## Why not empty space

Empty space is still space.

It already assumes:

extension  
location  
inside / outside  
distance  
container structure  

So empty space is also too late.

## Cleaner beginning

The cleaner starting phrase is:

**undifferentiated symmetry**

This means:

maximal sameness before difference.

Not chaos.

Not pieces.

Not particles.

Not emptiness.

Not an object.

Not a place.

Not a clock.

## What undifferentiated means

Undifferentiated means no stable distinction has appeared yet.

No this / that.

No here / there.

No before / after.

No inside / outside.

No object / background.

No measurable interval.

No local frame.

## What symmetry means here

Symmetry means no difference has yet broken the sameness.

There is no privileged side.

No marked location.

No separated object.

No chosen direction.

No measurable distance.

No stable count.

This is not a claim that a completed physical theory has been reached.

It is a restraint phrase.

It prevents the model from smuggling in space, time, objects, or measure too early.

## What the phrase protects

Undifferentiated symmetry protects the starting point from becoming secretly spatial.

It avoids saying:

something was somewhere.

It avoids saying:

something happened before time.

It avoids saying:

empty space existed first.

It avoids saying:

a point expanded into space.

Those may become useful later, but they cannot be the first unexplained assumption.

## Current position

The stage break forces the question backward.

If space, time, distance, locality, and measure cannot be assumed, then the beginning must be named without already using them.

The current candidate is:

**undifferentiated symmetry**

The next question is:

What is the first break in undifferentiated symmetry?

## Bridge to the next file

The first move cannot be an object.

An object already requires difference.

The first move cannot be a location.

Location already requires a frame.

The first move cannot be a clock-tick.

Clock-time has not been earned.

The first move must be more basic.

The current candidate is:

**distinction / relation**
